# LogMessage
msgid ""
msgstr ""
"Language: ru\n"
"Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8\n"
"X-Game-Version: 2026.09.15.0000.0000\n"
"X-Source-Language: en\n"

#. ja: 財宝探索を続ける場合は、最初の財宝を開けてから<sheet EventItem $n1 0>を使用してください。
#. de: Wenn du weiter nach Schätzen suchen willst, öffne den ersten Schatz und benutze danach <noun-de Item 1 $n1 1 4 1>.
#. fr: Pour continuer la chasse au trésor, veuillez ouvrir le coffre avant d'utiliser <noun-fr EventItem 1 $n1 1 1>.
#. macro: <noun-en EventItem 1 $n1 1 1> — an English noun from a game data sheet, with article and number; sheet = EventItem, form = 1, row = number parameter 1, count = 1, case = 1 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "LogMessage:11000:0:5"
msgid "Should you wish to hunt for additional treasure, first open the treasure coffer, then use <noun-en EventItem 1 $n1 1 1>."
msgstr "Если хотите найти ещё сокровища, сначала откройте сундук, а затем используйте <noun-en EventItem 1 $n1 1 1>."

#. ja: クレセントアイル解説に「<sheet DescriptionString 1224 0 23>」などのページが追加されました。
#. de: Der Eintrag „<sheet DescriptionString 1224 0 23>“ wurde den Erklärungen zu Kreszentia hinzugefügt.
#. fr: La rubrique “<sheet DescriptionString 1224 0 23>” a été ajoutée au guide de l'île de Lunule.
#. macro: <sheet DescriptionString 1224 0 23> — a value from a game data sheet, such as a name; sheet = DescriptionString, row = 1224, column = 0, parameter = 23 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "LogMessage:11001:0:5"
msgid "“<sheet DescriptionString 1224 0 23>” has been added to the Occult Crescent guide."
msgstr "В путеводителе по Тайному Полумесяцу появилась страница «<sheet DescriptionString 1224 0 23>»."

#. ja: 以下のクリティカルエンカウントに参加しました。<br><sheet DynamicEvent $n1 11>
#. de: Du nimmst an der kritischen Begegnung „<sheet DynamicEvent $n1 11>“ teil.
#. fr: Vous participez à la confrontation critique “<sheet DynamicEvent $n1 11>”.
#. macro: <sheet DynamicEvent $n1 11> — a value from a game data sheet, such as a name; sheet = DynamicEvent, row = number parameter 1, column = 11 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "LogMessage:11002:0:5"
msgid "You have joined the critical encounter “<sheet DynamicEvent $n1 11>.”"
msgstr "Вы присоединились к критическому столкновению «<sheet DynamicEvent $n1 11>»."

#. ja: 戦闘不能状態のため、クリティカルエンカウントに参加できません。
#. de: Du kannst nicht an der kritischen Begegnung teilnehmen, da du kampfunfähig bist.
#. fr: Impossible de participer à une confrontation critique en étant inconscient<if $gn4>e</if>.
msgctxt "LogMessage:11003:0:5"
msgid "You are incapacitated. Critical encounter cannot be joined."
msgstr "Вы недееспособны. Нельзя присоединиться к критическому столкновению."

#. ja: <sheet Item $n2 0><if ($n1 > 1)>×<kilo $n1 ","><if ($n3 == 0)><else>(+<num $n3>%)</if>を<else>を</if>使用した……
#. de: Du hast <if ($n1 == 1)><noun-de Item 1 $n2 1 4 1><else><kilo $n1 ","><if ($n3 == 0)><else>(+<num $n3>%)</if> <noun-de Item 5 $n2 2 4 1></if> benutzt.
#. fr: Vous offrez <num $n1> <noun-fr Item 12 $n2 "<if ($n1 <= 1)>{1}<else>{2}</if>" 1>.
#. macro: <if ($n1 == 1)><noun-en Item 1 $n2 1 1><else><kilo $n1 ","><if ($n3 == 0)><else>(+<num $n3>%)</if> <noun-en Item 3 $n2 3 1></if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = number parameter 1 == 1 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <noun-en Item 1 $n2 1 1> — an English noun from a game data sheet, with article and number; sheet = Item, form = 1, row = number parameter 2, count = 1, case = 1 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <kilo $n1 ","> — a number with a thousands separator; value = number parameter 1, separator = , (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <if ($n3 == 0)><else>(+<num $n3>%)</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = number parameter 3 == 0 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <num $n3> — a number; value = number parameter 3 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <noun-en Item 3 $n2 3 1> — an English noun from a game data sheet, with article and number; sheet = Item, form = 3, row = number parameter 2, count = 3, case = 1 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "LogMessage:11004:0:5"
msgid "You offer <if ($n1 == 1)><noun-en Item 1 $n2 1 1><else><kilo $n1 \",\"><if ($n3 == 0)><else>(+<num $n3>%)</if> <noun-en Item 3 $n2 3 1></if>."
msgstr "Вы подносите <if ($n1 == 1)><noun-en Item 1 $n2 1 1><else><kilo $n1 \",\"><if ($n3 == 0)><else>(+<num $n3>%)</if> <noun-en Item 3 $n2 3 1></if>."

#. ja: 「<sheet Status $n1 0>」を獲得した！
#. de: Du erhältst den Status „<sheet Status $n1 0>“!
#. fr: Vous recevez un <sheet Status $n1 0><nbsp>!
#. macro: <sheet Status $n1 0> — a value from a game data sheet, such as a name; sheet = Status, row = number parameter 1, column = 0 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "LogMessage:11005:0:5"
msgid "You are granted <sheet Status $n1 0>!"
msgstr "Вы получили статус «<sheet Status $n1 0>»!"

#. ja: 既定の参加人数を超えたため、使用した<sheet Item $n1 0>が返還されました。
#. de: Da es mehr Teilnehmer als offene Plätze gab, erhältst du <if ($n1 == 1)><noun-de Item 3 $n2 1 4 1><else><noun-de Item 3 $n2 2 4 1></if> zurück.
#. fr: La capacité de téléportation ayant été dépassée, vos <noun-fr Item 12 $n1 2 1> vous ont été rendus.
#. macro: <if ($n1 == 1)><noun-en Item 3 $n2 1 1><else><noun-en Item 3 $n2 3 1></if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = number parameter 1 == 1 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <noun-en Item 3 $n2 1 1> — an English noun from a game data sheet, with article and number; sheet = Item, form = 3, row = number parameter 2, count = 1, case = 1 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <noun-en Item 3 $n2 3 1> — an English noun from a game data sheet, with article and number; sheet = Item, form = 3, row = number parameter 2, count = 3, case = 1 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <if ($n1 == 1)>has<else>have</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = number parameter 1 == 1 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
msgctxt "LogMessage:11006:0:5"
msgid "The number of participants exceeded capacity─the <if ($n1 == 1)><noun-en Item 3 $n2 1 1><else><noun-en Item 3 $n2 3 1></if> you offered <if ($n1 == 1)>has<else>have</if> been returned."
msgstr "Число участников превысило лимит, поэтому <if ($n1 == 1)><noun-en Item 3 $n2 1 1><else><noun-en Item 3 $n2 3 1></if>, которое вы поднесли, было возвращено."

#. ja: <sheet BNpcName $n1 0>に対する「ぬすむ」の成果を得た！
#. de: Du hast <noun-de BNpcName 2 $n1 1 4 1> erfolgreich bestohlen!
#. fr: Votre butin est enrichi par votre vol sur <noun-fr BNpcName 2 $n1 1 1><nbsp>!
#. macro: <noun-en BNpcName 2 $n1 1 1> — an English noun from a game data sheet, with article and number; sheet = BNpcName, form = 2, row = number parameter 1, count = 1, case = 1 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "LogMessage:11009:0:5"
msgid "You successfully steal from <noun-en BNpcName 2 $n1 1 1>!"
msgstr "Вы успешно обокрали <noun-en BNpcName 2 $n1 1 1>!"

#. ja: 条件を満たしていないため、アクセスがキャンセルされました。
#. de: Du kannst dich nicht registrieren, weil die Voraus<shy>setzungen nicht erfüllt sind.
#. fr: Accès annulé. Les conditions ne sont pas remplies.
msgctxt "LogMessage:11010:0:5"
msgid "Unable to make offering. You do not meet the requirements."
msgstr "Не удалось сделать подношение. Вы не соответствуете требованиям."

#. ja: 条件を満たしていないため、コンテンツに参加できませんでした。
#. de: Du kannst an diesem Inhalt nicht teilnehmen, weil du die Voraus<shy>setzungen nicht erfüllst.
#. fr: Participation impossible. Les conditions ne sont pas remplies.
msgctxt "LogMessage:11011:0:5"
msgid "You do not meet the requirements to participate in this duty."
msgstr "Вы не соответствуете требованиям для участия в этом задании."

#. ja: サポートジョブ「<sheet MKDSupportJob $n1 0>」のマスターになった。
#. de: Du hast Meis<shy>ter<shy>schaft über den Phantomjob <if ($gn4 == 0)><sheet MKDSupportJob $n1 0><else><sheet MKDSupportJob $n1 2></if> erlangt!
#. fr: <sheet MKDSupportJob $n1 0> maîtrisé<nbsp>!
#. macro: <sheet MKDSupportJob $n1 0> — a value from a game data sheet, such as a name; sheet = MKDSupportJob, row = number parameter 1, column = 0 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "LogMessage:11012:0:5"
msgid "You have mastered the phantom job <sheet MKDSupportJob $n1 0>!"
msgstr "Вы овладели фантомной профессией «<sheet MKDSupportJob $n1 0>»!"

#. ja: <if $gn7><sheet ObjStr $gn7 0><else>{$gs2}</if>は、サポートジョブ「<sheet MKDSupportJob $n1 0>」のマスターになった。
#. de: <capitalize><if ($gs1 == $gs2)><switch 1><case>du<case>deiner<case>dir<case>dich</switch><else><if $gn7><noun-de ObjStr 2 $gn7 1 1 1><else>{$gs2}</if></if></capitalize> <if ($gs1 == $gs2)>hast<else>hat</if> Meis<shy>ter<shy>schaft über den Phantomjob <if ($gn4 == 0)><sheet MKDSupportJob $n1 0><else><sheet MKDSupportJob $n1 2></if> erlangt!
#. fr: <capitalize><if ($gs1 == $gs2)>vous<else><if $gn7><noun-fr ObjStr 2 $gn7 1 1><else><if (2 == 9)><if $gn66>d'<else>de<nbsp></if><string $gs2><else><if $gn5><sheet Attributive 2 36><string $gs2><else><sheet Attributive 2 28><string $gs2></if></if></if></if></capitalize> <if ($gs1 == $gs2)>avez maîtrisé<else>a maîtrisé</if> le job de soutien <sheet MKDSupportJob $n1 0>.
#. macro: <capitalize><if ($gs1 == $gs2)>you<else><if $gn7><noun-en ObjStr 2 $gn7 1 1><else>{$gs2}</if></if></capitalize> — the content with its first letter in upper case (may be added or dropped)
#. macro: <if ($gs1 == $gs2)>you<else><if $gn7><noun-en ObjStr 2 $gn7 1 1><else>{$gs2}</if></if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global text 1 (the name of the player character) == global text 2 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <if $gn7><noun-en ObjStr 2 $gn7 1 1><else>{$gs2}</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 7 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <noun-en ObjStr 2 $gn7 1 1> — an English noun from a game data sheet, with article and number; sheet = ObjStr, form = 2, row = global number 7, count = 1, case = 1 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <if ($gs1 == $gs2)>have<else>has</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global text 1 (the name of the player character) == global text 2 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <sheet MKDSupportJob $n1 0> — a value from a game data sheet, such as a name; sheet = MKDSupportJob, row = number parameter 1, column = 0 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "LogMessage:11013:0:5"
msgid "<capitalize><if ($gs1 == $gs2)>you<else><if $gn7><noun-en ObjStr 2 $gn7 1 1><else>{$gs2}</if></if></capitalize> <if ($gs1 == $gs2)>have<else>has</if> mastered the phantom job <sheet MKDSupportJob $n1 0>!"
msgstr "<capitalize><if ($gs1 == $gs2)>Вы<else><if $gn7><noun-en ObjStr 2 $gn7 1 1><else>{$gs2}</if></if></capitalize> овладел<if ($gs1 == $gs2)><else>а</if> фантомной профессией «<sheet MKDSupportJob $n1 0>»!"

#. ja: <if $gn7><sheet ObjStr $gn7 0><else>{$gs2}</if>はサポートアクション「<string $s1>」を修得した。
#. de: <capitalize><if ($gs1 == $gs2)><switch 1><case>du<case>deiner<case>dir<case>dich</switch><else><if $gn7><noun-de ObjStr 2 $gn7 1 1 1><else>{$gs2}</if></if></capitalize> <if ($gs1 == $gs2)>hast<else>hat</if> das Phantomkommando „<string $s1>“ erlernt!
#. fr: <capitalize><if ($gs1 == $gs2)>vous<else><if $gn7><noun-fr ObjStr 2 $gn7 1 1><else><if (2 == 9)><if $gn66>d'<else>de<nbsp></if><string $gs2><else><if $gn5><sheet Attributive 2 36><string $gs2><else><sheet Attributive 2 28><string $gs2></if></if></if></if></capitalize> <if ($gs1 == $gs2)>apprenez<else>apprend</if> l'action de soutien “<string $s1>”.
#. macro: <capitalize><if ($gs1 == $gs2)>you<else><if $gn7><noun-en ObjStr 2 $gn7 1 1><else>{$gs2}</if></if></capitalize> — the content with its first letter in upper case (may be added or dropped)
#. macro: <if ($gs1 == $gs2)>you<else><if $gn7><noun-en ObjStr 2 $gn7 1 1><else>{$gs2}</if></if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global text 1 (the name of the player character) == global text 2 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <if $gn7><noun-en ObjStr 2 $gn7 1 1><else>{$gs2}</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 7 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <noun-en ObjStr 2 $gn7 1 1> — an English noun from a game data sheet, with article and number; sheet = ObjStr, form = 2, row = global number 7, count = 1, case = 1 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <if ($gs1 == $gs2)>learn<else>learns</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global text 1 (the name of the player character) == global text 2 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <string $s1> — a text value passed to the string; value = text parameter 1 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "LogMessage:11014:0:5"
msgid "<capitalize><if ($gs1 == $gs2)>you<else><if $gn7><noun-en ObjStr 2 $gn7 1 1><else>{$gs2}</if></if></capitalize> <if ($gs1 == $gs2)>learn<else>learns</if> the phantom action <string $s1>."
msgstr "<capitalize><if ($gs1 == $gs2)>Вы<else><if $gn7><noun-en ObjStr 2 $gn7 1 1><else>{$gs2}</if></if></capitalize> изучил<if ($gs1 == $gs2)><else>а</if> фантомное умение «<string $s1>»."

#. ja: <if $gn7><sheet ObjStr $gn7 0><else>{$gs2}</if>はサポート特性「<sheet MKDTrait $n1 3>」を修得した。
#. de: <capitalize><if ($gs1 == $gs2)><switch 1><case>du<case>deiner<case>dir<case>dich</switch><else><if $gn7><noun-de ObjStr 2 $gn7 1 1 1><else>{$gs2}</if></if></capitalize> <if ($gs1 == $gs2)>hast<else>hat</if> die Phantomeigenschaft „<sheet MKDTrait $n1 3>“ erlernt!
#. fr: <capitalize><if ($gs1 == $gs2)>vous<else><if $gn7><noun-fr ObjStr 2 $gn7 1 1><else><if (2 == 9)><if $gn66>d'<else>de<nbsp></if><string $gs2><else><if $gn5><sheet Attributive 2 36><string $gs2><else><sheet Attributive 2 28><string $gs2></if></if></if></if></capitalize> <if ($gs1 == $gs2)>apprenez<else>apprend</if> le trait de soutien “<sheet MKDTrait $n1 3>”.
#. macro: <capitalize><if ($gs1 == $gs2)>you<else><if $gn7><noun-en ObjStr 2 $gn7 1 1><else>{$gs2}</if></if></capitalize> — the content with its first letter in upper case (may be added or dropped)
#. macro: <if ($gs1 == $gs2)>you<else><if $gn7><noun-en ObjStr 2 $gn7 1 1><else>{$gs2}</if></if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global text 1 (the name of the player character) == global text 2 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <if $gn7><noun-en ObjStr 2 $gn7 1 1><else>{$gs2}</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 7 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <noun-en ObjStr 2 $gn7 1 1> — an English noun from a game data sheet, with article and number; sheet = ObjStr, form = 2, row = global number 7, count = 1, case = 1 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <if ($gs1 == $gs2)>learn<else>learns</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global text 1 (the name of the player character) == global text 2 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <sheet MKDTrait $n1 3> — a value from a game data sheet, such as a name; sheet = MKDTrait, row = number parameter 1, column = 3 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "LogMessage:11015:0:5"
msgid "<capitalize><if ($gs1 == $gs2)>you<else><if $gn7><noun-en ObjStr 2 $gn7 1 1><else>{$gs2}</if></if></capitalize> <if ($gs1 == $gs2)>learn<else>learns</if> the phantom trait <sheet MKDTrait $n1 3>."
msgstr "<capitalize><if ($gs1 == $gs2)>Вы<else><if $gn7><noun-en ObjStr 2 $gn7 1 1><else>{$gs2}</if></if></capitalize> изучил<if ($gs1 == $gs2)><else>а</if> фантомную особенность «<sheet MKDTrait $n1 3>»."

#. ja: クレセントアイル解説に「<sheet DescriptionString 1213 0 23>」などのページが追加されました。
#. de: Der Eintrag „<sheet DescriptionString 1213 0 23>“ wurde den Erklärungen zu Kreszentia hinzugefügt.
#. fr: La rubrique “<sheet DescriptionString 1213 0 23>” a été ajoutée au guide de l'île de Lunule.
#. macro: <sheet DescriptionString 1213 0 23> — a value from a game data sheet, such as a name; sheet = DescriptionString, row = 1213, column = 0, parameter = 23 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "LogMessage:11016:0:5"
msgid "“<sheet DescriptionString 1213 0 23>” has been added to the Occult Crescent guide."
msgstr "В путеводителе по Тайному Полумесяцу появилась страница «<sheet DescriptionString 1213 0 23>»."

#. ja: 人数が上限を超えたため、コンテンツに参加できませんでした。
#. de: Du kannst nicht am Inhalt teilnehmen, da es mehr Teilnehmer als offene Plätze gab.
#. fr: Participation impossible. La capacité de téléportation a été dépassée.
msgctxt "LogMessage:11017:0:5"
msgid "Unable to participate. Aetherial node capacity exceeded."
msgstr "Участвовать нельзя: лимит вместимости эфирного узла превышен."

#. ja: <sheet ContentRoulette $n1 0>が開放されていません。
#. de: Du hast „<sheet ContentRoulette $n1 0>“ noch nicht freigeschaltet.
#. fr: Vous n'avez pas encore accès à la roulette “<sheet ContentRoulette $n1 0>”.
#. macro: <sheet ContentRoulette $n1 0> — a value from a game data sheet, such as a name; sheet = ContentRoulette, row = number parameter 1, column = 0 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "LogMessage:11018:0:5"
msgid "You have not unlocked <sheet ContentRoulette $n1 0>."
msgstr "Вы ещё не открыли «<sheet ContentRoulette $n1 0>»."

#. ja: ラーニング可能な青魔法が存在します。<br>サポート青魔道士の特性を確認してみましょう。
#. de: Neue Blaumagie kann erlernt werden. Überprüfe die Eigenschaften deines Phantom-Blaumagiers.
#. fr: Des actions de magie bleue peuvent être apprises. Consultez-les dans la fenêtre des détails du job de soutien.
msgctxt "LogMessage:11019:0:5"
msgid "Blue magic available to learn. Check your phantom traits."
msgstr "Доступна магия синего мага. Проверьте свои фантомные особенности."

#. ja: 本コンテンツに参加するには、最低12名のメンバーと、3つのアライアンスパーティが必要です。
#. de: Dieser Inhalt kann nur mit min. 12 Spielern sowie 3 Allianzen betreten werden.
#. fr: Un minimum de 12 personnages répartis dans 3 alliances est nécessaire.
msgctxt "LogMessage:11020:0:5"
msgid "A minimum of 12 players and 3 alliance parties are required to enter."
msgstr "Для входа требуется не менее 12 игроков и 3 альянсов."

#. ja: 「フォークタワー：魔の塔」に参加できなかったため、参加優先点を獲得しました。<br>次回以降、コンテンツの参加当選確率が上昇します。
#. de: Da du nicht zur Teilnahme ausgewählt wurdest, wurde deine Priorität für den Fork-Turm erhöht.<br>Hierdurch ist nächstes Mal deine Chance größer, ausgewählt zu werden.
#. fr: Votre échec au tirage au sort a augmenté votre score de priorité pour la Tour fourchue de la Magie.<br>Vos chances de sélection seront plus élevées lors de la prochaine tentative.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "LogMessage:11021:0:5"
msgid "Ingress unsuccessful. Your Forked Tower Priority has been increased.<br>The next time you attempt access, your chance for selection will be higher."
msgstr "Не удалось пройти отбор. Приоритет для Башни Развилки: Магия повышен.<br>При следующей попытке вас с большей вероятностью выберут."

#. ja: 「フォークタワー：魔の塔」に参加したため、参加優先点がリセットされました。
#. de: Da du zur Teilnahme ausgewählt wurdest, wurde deine Priorität für den Fork-Turm auf 0 zurückgesetzt.
#. fr: Votre réussite au tirage au sort a réinitialisé votre score de priorité pour la Tour fourchue de la Magie.
msgctxt "LogMessage:11022:0:5"
msgid "Ingress successful. Your Forked Tower Priority has been reset."
msgstr "Отбор пройден. Приоритет для Башни Развилки: Магия сброшен."

