#. macro: <noun-en EObj 3 $n1 2 1> — an English noun from a game data sheet, with article and number; sheet = EObj, form = 3, row = number parameter 1, count = 2, case = 1 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "LogMessage:11550:0:5"
msgid "Disperse <noun-en EventItem 3 $n2 2 1> on three <noun-en EObj 3 $n1 2 1> to spur their growth."
msgstr "Рассыпьте <noun-en EventItem 3 $n2 2 1> на трёх <noun-en EObj 3 $n1 2 1>, чтобы ускорить их рост."

#. ja: <if $gn7><sheet ObjStr $gn7 0><else>{$gs2}</if>は、<sheet EventItem $n2 0>をすべて散布した！<br><sheet EObj $n1 0>で補充しよう。
#. de: <capitalize><if ($gs1 == $gs2)><switch 1><case>du<case>deiner<case>dir<case>dich</switch><else><if $gn7><noun-de ObjStr 2 $gn7 1 1 1><else>{$gs2}</if></if></capitalize> <if ($gs1 == $gs2)>hast<else>hat</if> die Aufgabe abgeschlossen.<br>Das Wachstumsmittel wurde aufgebraucht. Besorge neues an der Nachfüllstation.
#. fr: <capitalize><if ($gs1 == $gs2)>vous<else><if $gn7><noun-fr ObjStr 2 $gn7 1 1><else><if (2 == 9)><if $gn66>d'<else>de<nbsp></if><string $gs2><else><if $gn5><sheet Attributive 2 36><string $gs2><else><sheet Attributive 2 28><string $gs2></if></if></if></if></capitalize> <if ($gs1 == $gs2)>êtes<else>est</if> à court <noun-fr EventItem 8 $n2 1 1><nbsp>!<br>Faites le plein à <noun-fr EObj 1 $n1 1 1>.
#. macro: <noun-en EventItem 2 $n2 2 1> — an English noun from a game data sheet, with article and number; sheet = EventItem, form = 2, row = number parameter 2, count = 2, case = 1 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
#. macro: <noun-en EObj 1 $n1 1 1> — an English noun from a game data sheet, with article and number; sheet = EObj, form = 1, row = number parameter 1, count = 1, case = 1 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "LogMessage:11551:0:5"
msgid "You have used all <noun-en EventItem 2 $n2 2 1>.<br>Refill them at <noun-en EObj 1 $n1 1 1>."
msgstr "Вы использовали все <noun-en EventItem 2 $n2 2 1>.<br>Пополните запас у <noun-en EObj 1 $n1 1 1>."

#. ja: <sheet EObj $n1 0>に<sheet EventItem $n2 0>を散布し、活性化しよう。
#. de: Verwende <noun-de EventItem 5 $n2 2 3 1>, um <noun-de EObj 2 $n1 2 4 1> zu revitalisieren.
#. fr: Arrosez <noun-fr EObj 2 $n1 2 1> <noun-fr EventItem 8 $n2 1 1> pour les revitaliser.
