#. macro: <noun-en EObj 3 $n1 2 1> — an English noun from a game data sheet, with article and number; sheet = EObj, form = 3, row = number parameter 1, count = 2, case = 1 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "LogMessage:11552:0:5"
msgid "Disperse <noun-en EventItem 3 $n2 2 1> on <noun-en EObj 3 $n1 2 1> to spur their growth."
msgstr "Рассыпьте <noun-en EventItem 3 $n2 2 1> на <noun-en EObj 3 $n1 2 1>, чтобы ускорить их рост."

#. ja: <sheet EventItem $n2 0>3つを、<sheet EObj $n1 0>に取り付けよう。
#. de: Verbaue <noun-de EventItem 5 $n2 2 4 1> an <noun-de EObj 2 $n1 2 3 1>.
#. fr: Remplacez trois <noun-fr EObj 12 $n1 2 1> par <noun-fr EventItem 1 $n2 2 1>.
#. macro: <noun-en EventItem 3 $n2 2 1> — an English noun from a game data sheet, with article and number; sheet = EventItem, form = 3, row = number parameter 2, count = 2, case = 1 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <noun-en EObj 3 $n1 2 1> — an English noun from a game data sheet, with article and number; sheet = EObj, form = 3, row = number parameter 1, count = 2, case = 1 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "LogMessage:11553:0:5"
msgid "Install three <noun-en EventItem 3 $n2 2 1> on <noun-en EObj 3 $n1 2 1>."
msgstr "Установите три <noun-en EventItem 3 $n2 2 1> на <noun-en EObj 3 $n1 2 1>."

#. ja: <if $gn7><sheet ObjStr $gn7 0><else>{$gs2}</if>は、入手した<sheet EventItem $n2 0>をすべて取り付けた！<br><sheet EObj $n1 0>で<sheet EventItem $n2 0>を受け取ろう。
#. de: <capitalize><if ($gs1 == $gs2)><switch 1><case>du<case>deiner<case>dir<case>dich</switch><else><if $gn7><noun-de ObjStr 2 $gn7 1 1 1><else>{$gs2}</if></if></capitalize> <if ($gs1 == $gs2)>hast<else>hat</if> die Aufgabe abgeschlossen.<br>Die Drohnenteile wurden aufgebraucht. Besorge neue aus dem Drohnenteil-Behälter.
#. fr: <capitalize><if ($gs1 == $gs2)>vous<else><if $gn7><noun-fr ObjStr 2 $gn7 1 1><else><if (2 == 9)><if $gn66>d'<else>de<nbsp></if><string $gs2><else><if $gn5><sheet Attributive 2 36><string $gs2><else><sheet Attributive 2 28><string $gs2></if></if></if></if></capitalize> <if ($gs1 == $gs2)>avez<else>a</if> remplacé tous les composants endommagés<nbsp>!<br>Retournez à <noun-fr EObj 1 $n1 1 1> chercher de nouvelles <noun-fr EventItem 12 $n2 2 1>.
