msgid "<capitalize><if ($gs1 == $gs3)><if $gn8><noun-en ObjStr 2 $gn8 1 1><else>you</if><else><if $gn8><noun-en ObjStr 2 $gn8 1 1><else>{$gs3}</if></if></capitalize> ruffles their feathers indignantly."
